  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC 71th Mains Admit Card 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-04-17T10:09:43+05:30\">April 17, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:09 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a></strong>\u00a0has released the <strong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"197\">Mains Admit Card</strong> on its official website for the <strong data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"250\">71st Combined Competitive Examination (CCE) 2025</strong>. The <strong data-end=\"322\" data-start=\"308\">mains exam</strong> will be conducted from <strong data-end=\"369\" data-start=\"346\">25 to 30 April 2026</strong>. The <strong data-end=\"405\" data-start=\"375\">online application process</strong> for the <strong data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"414\">BPSC 71st Mains Online Form 2025</strong> started on <strong data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"462\">03 December 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to apply until <strong data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"524\">24 December 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"573\">Admit Card</strong> using their <strong data-end=\"649\" data-start=\"600\">Application Number, Password, or Security Pin</strong> by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"