td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Notice For 14 DSP Post Added</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.114%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/Notices/NB-2025-06-18-01.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Official Notification</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.114%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/Notices/NB-2025-05-30-06.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Bihar BPSC Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.114%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0BPSC 71th Mains Admit Card 2026 : Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When will the <strong>admit card be released?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The admit card has released <strong data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"266\">before the Mains exam</strong>.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is it mandatory to <strong>carry the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, <strong data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"901\">without the admit card entry is not allowed</strong> in the exam hall.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What if there is an <strong>error in the admit card?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Immediately contact <strong data-end=\"1232\" data-start=\"1191\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Bihar Public Service Commission</span></span></strong> for correction.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Can I show the <strong>admit card on mobile?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: No, only a printed copy is accepted.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar BPSC</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Bihar BPSC </strong></span>is <strong>https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"BPSC 71th Mains Admit Card 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-33254 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"575\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/BPSC-1024x575.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/BPSC-1024x575.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/BPSC-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/BPSC-768x431.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/BPSC.jpg 1200w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"dc7d267e5e9d3c54920bd4cd-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163